title: TEST_Hub
---
Player: (TEST) Hub. flow_phase = {flow_phase()}, flow_step = {flow_step()}
-> Camera
    <<jump TEST_Camera>>
-> NPC (Isla)
    <<jump TEST_NPC>>
-> Order functions (no drink made)
    <<jump TEST_Orders>>
-> Flow steps without making a drink
    <<jump TEST_FlowSteps>>
-> Real order: make and serve a drink
    <<jump TEST_RealOrder>>
-> Ingredient unlock
    <<jump TEST_Unlock>>
-> Misc (wait, interactables, event log, summary)
    <<jump TEST_Misc>>
-> End of day (close bar, next day) - ends the test
    <<jump TEST_EndDay>>
===

title: TEST_Camera
---
// Static commands: the first word (CamController) is ignored.
<<Switch_Camera CamController CenterCam>>
Player: (TEST) Switch_Camera CenterCam (blend).
<<Cut_Camera CamController MainCam>>
Player: (TEST) Cut_Camera MainCam (no blend).
<<jump TEST_Hub>>
===

title: TEST_NPC
---
// Characters: long form, short form, expression by name and by number, look L/F/R, spots.
// Isla uses legacy art: a look shows the whole-body Look picture, an expression shows its picture and turns her forward.
// Enter and Exit hold the dialogue until the fade is over.
<<Isla Look L>>
<<Isla Sad>>
Player: (TEST) Set while Isla is outside: Look L + Sad remembered, nothing on screen yet.
<<CharacterEnter CharacterName.Isla 2>>
Player: (TEST) CharacterEnter Isla 2 (long form) finished: she is on spot 2 looking Left with the Sad face (Forward face + a warning, Sad has no side face).
<<CharacterExpression CharacterName.Isla Happy>>
Player: (TEST) CharacterExpression Happy by name (long form). Looking Left: the Right face flipped.
<<Isla 0>>
Player: (TEST) Short form by number: "Isla 0" = Neutral (its own Left face).
<<Isla Sad>>
<<CharacterExpression CharacterName.Isla 1>>
Player: (TEST) CharacterExpression 1 by number = Happy.
<<CharacterLook CharacterName.Isla R>>
Player: (TEST) CharacterLook R (long form): body and face turn to the Right.
<<Isla Look F>>
Player: (TEST) Short form "Isla Look F": Forward.
<<Isla Nonsense>>
Player: (TEST) Unknown expression "Isla Nonsense" must only warn and keep the face.
<<Isla Enter 2>>
Player: (TEST) Enter the same spot again: nothing happens.
<<Isla Enter 3>>
Player: (TEST) Enter a different spot (3): faded out, moved, faded in. Dialogue waited for all of it.
<<Isla Enter>>
Player: (TEST) Enter with no number goes to spot 0.
<<Isla Exit>>
Player: (TEST) Exit (short form) finished: Isla faded out.
<<Isla Exit>>
<<CharacterExit CharacterName.Isla>>
Player: (TEST) Exit while outside (both forms): nothing happens.
<<Isla Neutral>>
<<Isla Look F>>
<<jump TEST_AllCharacters>>
===

title: TEST_Orders
---
// order_customer: optional, names the customer for the next order.
<<order_customer "[CocktailSystem]" Isla>>
Player: (TEST) Named order: {Order_Cocktail_ByName_OutName("Gin Fizz")}
Player: (TEST) Same order described: {Order_Cocktail_ByName_OutDescription("Gin Fizz")}
Player: (TEST) order_name = {order_name()}, order_type = {order_type()}
Player: (TEST) order_flavor = {order_flavor()}

// Random from the customer's preferences. Argument is CharacterName as a number (Isla = 5).
Player: (TEST) Random for Isla: {Order_Cocktail_OutName(5)}
Player: (TEST) Its description: {Order_Cocktail_OutDescription(5)} (must be the SAME drink)

// Mode 5: a type only.
<<order_by_type "[CocktailSystem]" HighAlcohol>>
Player: (TEST) order_by_type HighAlcohol. order_type = {order_type()}, order_name = {order_name()}

<<Reset_Variable SystemGame>>
Player: (TEST) Reset_Variable. order_name = "{order_name()}" (expect empty), order_satisfaction = {order_satisfaction()}
<<jump TEST_Hub>>
===

title: TEST_FlowSteps
---
// Walks every Open Bar step from Yarn. The minigame UI may open at 2.2; ignore it.
<<order_customer "[CocktailSystem]" Isla>>
Player: (TEST) Order for the walk: {Order_Cocktail_ByName_OutName("Gin Fizz")}
<<flow_prepare_drinks>>
Player: (TEST) flow_prepare_drinks. step = {flow_step()} (expect AddIngredient)
<<flow_minigame Shaking>>
Player: (TEST) flow_minigame Shaking. flow_minigame_type = {flow_minigame_type()} (no transition, still {flow_step()})
<<flow_ingredient_added>>
Player: (TEST) flow_ingredient_added. step = {flow_step()} (expect Minigame)
<<flow_another_ingredient>>
Player: (TEST) flow_another_ingredient. step = {flow_step()} (expect AddIngredient)
<<flow_ingredient_added Stirring>>
Player: (TEST) flow_ingredient_added Stirring. step = {flow_step()}, type = {flow_minigame_type()} (expect Minigame / Stiring)
Player: (TEST) flow_minigame_result = "{flow_minigame_result()}" (empty until a minigame reported back)
<<flow_drink_complete>>
Player: (TEST) flow_drink_complete. step = {flow_step()} (expect Garnish)
<<flow_remake_drink>>
Player: (TEST) flow_remake_drink from Garnish. step = {flow_step()} (expect AddIngredient)
<<flow_ingredient_added>>
<<flow_drink_complete>>
<<flow_garnish_done>>
Player: (TEST) flow_garnish_done. step = {flow_step()} (expect Serve)
<<flow_serve_done>>
Player: (TEST) flow_serve_done. step = {flow_step()} (expect TalkingWithCustomer). Score is given here.
Player: (TEST) order_satisfaction = {order_satisfaction()}
<<Reset_Variable SystemGame>>
// From Talking these must only warn:
<<flow_remake_drink>>
<<flow_check_events>>
Player: (TEST) flow_remake_drink and flow_check_events from Talking should have only warned.
<<jump TEST_Hub>>
===

title: TEST_RealOrder
---
<<order_customer "[CocktailSystem]" Isla>>
Player: (TEST) Make this: [order] {Order_Cocktail_ByName_OutName("Gin Fizz")} [/order]
<<flow_prepare_drinks>>
// Suspends here until the drink is served and scored.
<<wait_for_task SystemGame>>
Player: (TEST) wait_for_task returned. order_satisfaction = {order_satisfaction()}, served type = {$type_of_cocktail}
<<Reset_Variable SystemGame>>
<<jump TEST_Hub>>
===

title: TEST_UnlockPopup
---
// BeforeOpen only: the Event popup. Pretends it is day 3, then puts $day back.
<<declare $test_saved_day = 1>>
<<set $test_saved_day to $day>>
<<set $day to 3>>
<<unlock_ingredient Rum>>
Player: (TEST) $day set to 3 and Rum unlocked by the story. Whiskey = {ingredient_unlocked("Whiskey")}, Rum = {ingredient_unlocked("Rum")} (expect True, True)
Player: (TEST) Next: flow_check_events. Expect ONE popup "Unlock New Ingredient" listing Whiskey, Dry Vermouth, Peppermint, Rum (one per line). Close it to go on.
<<flow_check_events>>
Player: (TEST) Back in the story. flow_step = {flow_step()} (expect StoryBeforeOpen)
<<flow_check_events>>
Player: (TEST) Second flow_check_events: NO popup (all already announced).
<<set $day to $test_saved_day>>
Player: (TEST) $day back to {$day}. Whiskey = {ingredient_unlocked("Whiskey")} (False again on day 1), Rum = {ingredient_unlocked("Rum")} (still True: story unlocks are permanent)
<<jump TEST_OpenBar>>
===

title: TEST_Unlock
---
// Ingredient unlock (Docs/YarnCommands/unlock_ingredient.md, ingredient_unlocked.md).
// Day table: 1 Vodka Gin Triplesec Soda CranberryJuice LemonJuice GrapefruitJuice Syrup,
// 3 Whiskey DryVermouth PepperMint, 5 Rum SweetVermouth LimeJuice OrangeJuice, 7 Tequila Campari.
Player: (TEST) Unlock hub. Day {$day}.
-> What is unlocked today
    <<jump TEST_Unlock_Today>>
-> Story unlock (command, repeat, letter case, bad name)
    <<jump TEST_Unlock_Story>>
-> Bar: bottles on the shelf
    <<jump TEST_Unlock_Bar>>
-> Orders: random only makeable, named warns
    <<jump TEST_Unlock_Orders>>
-> Back to the hub
    <<jump TEST_Hub>>
===

title: TEST_Unlock_Today
---
Player: (TEST) Day 1 - Vodka {ingredient_unlocked("Vodka")}, Gin {ingredient_unlocked("Gin")}, Triplesec {ingredient_unlocked("Triplesec")}, Soda {ingredient_unlocked("Soda")}
Player: (TEST) Day 1 - CranberryJuice {ingredient_unlocked("CranberryJuice")}, LemonJuice {ingredient_unlocked("LemonJuice")}, GrapefruitJuice {ingredient_unlocked("GrapefruitJuice")}, Syrup {ingredient_unlocked("Syrup")} (all True)
Player: (TEST) Day 3 - Whiskey {ingredient_unlocked("Whiskey")}, DryVermouth {ingredient_unlocked("DryVermouth")}, PepperMint {ingredient_unlocked("PepperMint")} (True from day 3)
Player: (TEST) Day 5 - Rum {ingredient_unlocked("Rum")}, SweetVermouth {ingredient_unlocked("SweetVermouth")}, LimeJuice {ingredient_unlocked("LimeJuice")}, OrangeJuice {ingredient_unlocked("OrangeJuice")} (True from day 5, Rum also after the popup test)
Player: (TEST) Day 7 - Tequila {ingredient_unlocked("Tequila")}, Campari {ingredient_unlocked("Campari")} (True from day 7 or after a story unlock)
<<jump TEST_Unlock>>
===

title: TEST_Unlock_Story
---
// Run before day 7: Tequila starts locked.
Player: (TEST) Before: Tequila = {ingredient_unlocked("Tequila")} (expect False before day 7)
<<unlock_ingredient Tequila>>
<<unlock_ingredient Tequila>>
<<unlock_ingredient tequila>>
Player: (TEST) unlock_ingredient Tequila, again, and "tequila": no error. Tequila = {ingredient_unlocked("Tequila")}, "TEQUILA" = {ingredient_unlocked("TEQUILA")} (expect True, True)
Player: (TEST) Next: an unknown name. The Console should show one LogError and the dialogue should go on.
<<unlock_ingredient NotAnIngredient>>
Player: (TEST) After the error. ingredient_unlocked("NotAnIngredient") = {ingredient_unlocked("NotAnIngredient")} (expect False, with a second LogError)
Player: (TEST) Its popup is not shown today: it waits for the next Event.
<<jump TEST_Unlock>>
===

title: TEST_Unlock_Bar
---
// Look at the shelf: only unlocked bottles show. Ice, Method and Reset always stay.
<<order_customer "[CocktailSystem]" Isla>>
Player: (TEST) Order for the look: {Order_Cocktail_ByName_OutName("Gin Fizz")}
<<flow_prepare_drinks>>
Player: (TEST) At the bar (step = {flow_step()}). Day 1: 8 bottles (+ any story unlocks: Rum, Tequila if run). Whiskey, Campari... hidden.
<<unlock_ingredient Campari>>
<<flow_ingredient_added>>
<<flow_another_ingredient>>
Player: (TEST) Campari unlocked, then left and came back to AddIngredient: the Campari bottle should now show.
<<flow_ingredient_added>>
<<flow_drink_complete>>
<<flow_garnish_done>>
<<flow_serve_done>>
<<Reset_Variable SystemGame>>
Player: (TEST) Back to Talking. step = {flow_step()}
<<jump TEST_Unlock>>
===

title: TEST_Unlock_Orders
---
// Random orders pick only drinks whose every ingredient is unlocked (day 1: John Collins, White Lady, Gin Fizz,
// Sea Breeze, Cosmopolitan, Greyhound, Cranberry Fizz, Grapefruit Spritz, plus any opened by story unlocks).
Player: (TEST) Random for Isla: {Order_Cocktail_OutName(5)}
Player: (TEST) Random for Isla: {Order_Cocktail_OutName(5)}
Player: (TEST) Random for Isla: {Order_Cocktail_OutName(5)}
Player: (TEST) Random for Owen: {Order_Cocktail_OutName(2)}
Player: (TEST) Random for Walter: {Order_Cocktail_OutName(3)}
Player: (TEST) Every name above must be makeable today.
// A drink the writer names is never filtered: it only warns in the Console when it cannot be made yet.
Player: (TEST) Named: {Order_Cocktail_ByName_OutName("Paloma")} (Tequila, Soda, LimeJuice, GrapefruitJuice, Syrup: warns while LimeJuice, day 5, is locked)
<<Reset_Variable SystemGame>>
<<jump TEST_Unlock>>
===

title: TEST_Misc
---
<<wait_scene 1>>
Player: (TEST) wait_scene 1 waited one second (skipped while Skip runs).
<<eventlog_clear>>
Player: (TEST) eventlog_clear: the Event Log should now start from this line.
// save_chapter_node is not tested here: [SaveLoadSystem] is inactive in the main scene, and an
// instance command whose target is missing stops the dialogue. See Docs/YarnCommands/save_chapter_node.md.
<<Fade_To_Summmary Panel_Transition>>
Player: (TEST) Fade_To_Summmary done.
<<Panel_FadeIn Panel_Transition>>
Player: (TEST) Panel_FadeIn back from the summary.
<<jump TEST_Hub>>
===

title: TEST_EndDay
---
<<Can_End_Shift SystemGame>>
Player: (TEST) Can_End_Shift: the End Shift button should appear.
<<flow_close_bar>>
Player: (TEST) flow_close_bar. flow_phase = {flow_phase()} (expect Close)
<<flow_next_day>>
Player: (TEST) flow_next_day. flow_phase = {flow_phase()}, flow_step = {flow_step()} (expect BeforeOpen / StoryBeforeOpen; the next day's node starts once this dialogue ends)
Player: (TEST) Day is now {$day}. Unlocks announced at the next day's Event (popup if anything new: story unlocks from today, or day 3/5/7 ingredients).
<<DisplayThx>>
Player: (TEST) DisplayThx: the thank-you panel should be on screen. End of test.
===
